Package: excelsioR
Title: Tidy Retrieval of Often Untidy Spreadsheet Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Cesaire",
           family = "Tobias",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cesairetobias@hotmail.com")
Description: Read and write data between R and Excel. Provides tools for handling
    untidy spreadsheets, including support for password-protected workbooks and
    time series data. Reads data safely from copies to prevent file corruption.
    Uses cell-level access via 'tidyxl' (Mayank et al. (2024)
    <https://nacnudus.github.io/tidyxl/>) for flexible extraction from
    presentation-style spreadsheets.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
